ll,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-08-19T19:30:46Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T21:09:53Z","closed_at":"2026-08-20T20:07:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n• Firefox 153.0.4 • Firefox Nightly 156.0a1 (2026-08-18)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 550 / 550 Series (radeonsi, polaris12, ACO, DRM 3.57, 6.8.0-138-generic) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700 CPU @ 3.40GHz (8 threads) - 7.71 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nDespite opening the Website on Linux, clicking the \"Download\" Button on https://godotengine.org brings me to download the Windows Version of Godot.\n\nAfter opening https://godotengine.org/download/linux, future Clicks on the Download&nbsp;Button correctly bring me to that Page instead of the Windows&nbsp;Version, but i still had an inconvenient first&nbsp;Impression.\n\nThis may be a Side&nbsp;Effect of Privacy&nbsp;Design in the Web&nbsp;Browser.\nI’m not sure if they’re actually doing it\nbut it seems on&#x2011;Brand for Firefox to crack&nbsp;down on Websites’ Ability to detect my Operating&nbsp;System.\n\nAs such, the Solution would not be to try to fix our Download&nbsp;Page’s Operating&nbsp;System&nbsp;Detection\nbut to redesign the Download Page slightly:\nDisplay the Windows&nbsp;Download&nbsp;Link, Mac&nbsp;Download&nbsp;Link, and Linux&nbsp;Download&nbsp;Link next&nbsp;to each&nbsp;other on one unified Desktop&nbsp;Download&nbsp;Page, instead&nbsp;of a separate Page for each&nbsp;System.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open a private&nbsp;Tab or a fresh&nbsp;Profile in Firefox&nbsp;on&nbsp;Linux\n3. Navigate to https://godotengine.org\n4. Click Download\n5. Note the Download Button has the Windows&nbsp;Logo, not the Linux&nbsp;Penguin,\n   and the opened URL is also https://godotengine.org/download/windows\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot applicable","closed_by":{"login":"poyribn","id":66305550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzA1NTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66305550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/poyribn","html_url":"https://github.com/poyribn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poyribn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poyribn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poyribn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poyribn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poyribn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poyribn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poyribn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poyribn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/poyribn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122608/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122608/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}